as/e6325021c7a5da3a9b40bb56f0003a36.poster.avif?t=1756210764\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/e6325021c7a5da3a9b40bb56f0003a36.webm?t=1756210764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/e6325021c7a5da3a9b40bb56f0003a36.mp4?t=1756210764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/0049d48c8d6b86aab423513c198a55b0.poster.avif?t=1756210764\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/0049d48c8d6b86aab423513c198a55b0.webm?t=1756210764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/0049d48c8d6b86aab423513c198a55b0.mp4?t=1756210764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/bc071b25fec03bcde2c302350a1230b2.poster.avif?t=1756210764\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/bc071b25fec03bcde2c302350a1230b2.webm?t=1756210764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/bc071b25fec03bcde2c302350a1230b2.mp4?t=1756210764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/3f302de3a03e303f8b11e7ee44289205.avif?t=1756210764\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Bow\u2019s first dreamlike experience, where reality begins to blur into a twisted nightmare. Explore a distorted cave and try to escape the nightmare state.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against shadowy nightmare creatures in real-time combat. Use Bow\u2019s emerging telekinetic powers and the help of his companion dog, <strong>Meeko</strong>, to survive \u2014 and challenge yourself in a\u00a0boss fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting, dreamlike soundtrack that shifts between eerie tension and hopeful calm, setting the tone for Bow\u2019s first steps into the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Taste of the Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the cinematic opening cutscene and meet Bow, a teenager caught between reality and dreams. Encounter Meeko, his loyal helper, and experience the first hints of the larger story that will unfold in the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactive Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Meeko</strong>, Bow\u2019s friendly helper dog. Control him directly, send commands, and use his support to overcome obstacles within the nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Corner of High School Hills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet some of its locals, and try a few side quests that hint at the town\u2019s deeper mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included in the Demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac Cinematic introduction to the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc15 Meet <strong>Meeko</strong>, Bow\u2019s friendly helper dog \u2013 control him and send commands to assist you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 Surreal dream sequence where reality bends into nightmares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Use Bow\u2019s basic telekinetic abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Combat against nightmare creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 Face a challenging <strong>boss fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960230?t=1756210764","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960230?t=1756210764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/3c8f3cdd9303e60342134b370b5152fd7c9dca5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756210764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/3c8f3cdd9303e60342134b370b5152fd7c9dca5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756210764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/e5e76c848c5af07539439876c5e07632.poster.avif?t=1756210764\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/e5e76c848c5af07539439876c5e07632.webm?t=1756210764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960230/extras/e5e76c848c5af07539439876c5e07632.mp4?t=1756210764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High School